# Translation updated at 2026-07-14 09:30

# game/script.rpy:41
translate English start_45797772:

    # "Pagi ini dimulai dengan bencana."
    "This morning began with a disaster."

# game/script.rpy:45
translate English start_c1e8f270:

    # "Alarm ponselmu mati, dan kamu hanya punya waktu 15 menit sebelum shift di café dimulai."
    "Your phone alarm died, and you only have 15 minutes before your shift at the café starts."

# game/script.rpy:48
translate English start_977b09e8:

    # y "Ya ampun aku telat!" with hpunch
    y "Oh no, I'm late!" with hpunch

# game/script.rpy:54
translate English start_291baabc:

    # "Dengan berpakaian terburu-buru dan langsung menutup pintu apartemen."
    "You throw on your clothes in a hurry and slam the apartment door behind you."

# game/script.rpy:61
translate English start_b955f818:

    # "Kamu berlari keluar..."
    "You run outside..."

# game/script.rpy:66
translate English start_acc32332:

    # "Kamu menyusuri trotoar padat, tidak menyadari bahwa hidupmu yang tenang akan segera berubah."
    "You rush down the crowded sidewalk, unaware that your quiet life is about to change."

# game/script.rpy:68
translate English start_54e428ab:

    # "Kamu berlari kencang hingga..."
    "You run at full speed until..."

# game/script.rpy:78
translate English start_875ee60c:

    # "{b}BRAK!{/b}"
    "{b}THUD!{/b}"

# game/script.rpy:80
translate English start_bbf921b6:

    # "Kamu menabrak dada seseorang yang sekeras beton. Tubuhmu terpental..."
    "You crash into someone's chest — hard as concrete. Your body bounces back..."

# game/script.rpy:81
translate English start_a2b46091:

    # "Tapi sebuah tangan kekar menangkap pinggangmu sebelum kamu jatuh ke aspal."
    "But a strong hand catches your waist before you hit the pavement."

# game/script.rpy:86
translate English start_d5a324f3:

    # "Caesar menatapmu dengan intensitas yang membuat napasmu tertahan. Dia tidak marah, justru ada seringai tipis di bibirnya."
    "Caesar stares at you with an intensity that steals your breath. He isn't angry — instead, a faint smirk plays on his lips."

# game/script.rpy:88
translate English start_5d9451b8:

    # c "Terburu-buru, {i}Malen'kaya moya{/i}?"
    c "In a hurry, {i}Malen'kaya moya{/i}?"

# game/script.rpy:89
translate English start_70166427:

    # c "Lain kali, lihat jalan... atau aku akan berpikir kau sengaja menjatuhkan diri ke pelukanku."
    c "Next time, watch where you're going... or I'll start thinking you threw yourself into my arms on purpose."

# game/script.rpy:91
translate English start_4f7cc2ea:

    # "Belum sempat kamu meminta maaf, ponselmu bergetar hebat di saku."
    "Before you can apologize, your phone buzzes violently in your pocket."

# game/script.rpy:94
translate English start_1aba0a56:

    # "'Y/N, kau di mana? Aku akan ke cafe dan membawakan bekal favoritmu. Hati-hati di jalan dan jangan lupa kabari aku kalau sudah sampai, oke?'"
    "'Y/N, where are you? I'm heading to the café with your favorite lunch. Be careful on the way, and don't forget to text me when you arrive, okay?'"

# game/script.rpy:97
translate English start_5a6d0ddf:

    # "Kamu segera melanjutkan lari menuju kafe."
    "You quickly resume your run toward the café."

# game/script.rpy:103
translate English start_dd04b7c1:

    # "(30 Menit Kemudian)"
    "(30 Minutes Later)"

# game/script.rpy:104
translate English start_0c68f878:

    # "Kamu akhirnya sampai dan memulai shift pagi mu. Temanmu yang sudah bersiap hanya bisa menggelengkan kepala."
    "You finally arrive and start your morning shift. Your coworker, already prepared, can only shake their head."

# game/script.rpy:110
translate English start_3f8f3ac0:

    # "Waktu berlalu dari pagi menuju siang. Pelanggan makin berdatangan, terlebih saat jam makan siang."
    "Morning slips into afternoon. More and more customers pour in, especially during the lunch rush."

# game/script.rpy:111
translate English start_dad950ae:

    # "Kamu sedikit kerepotan tetapi bekerja dengan sangat baik."
    "You're a little overwhelmed, but you handle it remarkably well."

# game/script.rpy:113
translate English start_4761affe:

    # "Break time telah tiba. Kamu mulai ke ruang staff dan meraih ponsel."
    "Break time arrives. You head to the staff room and grab your phone."

# game/script.rpy:115
translate English start_c5c20557:

    # "'Pesan Masuk & Missed Call: Yeo Taeju] : 'Y/N, aku sudah di depan café-mu. Keluar dan ambil bekalmu ini, aku tidak mau kamu skip makan siang.'"
    "'New Message & Missed Call: Yeo Taeju] : 'Y/N, I'm outside your café. Come out and get your lunch — I won't let you skip a meal.'"

# game/script.rpy:121
translate English start_6cc01e54:

    # "Kamu keluar café dari pintu belakang dan menemui Taeju yang sedang membawa bekal untukmu."
    "You slip out the back door of the café and find Taeju waiting with a lunchbox for you."

# game/script.rpy:124
translate English start_0e5729f6:

    # "Senyum hangat berada di bibirnya."
    "A warm smile rests on his lips."

# game/script.rpy:126
translate English start_7aa54430:

    # t "Akhirnya kau keluar juga."
    t "Finally, you came out."

# game/script.rpy:127
translate English start_b323ca82:

    # "Dia tersenyum lembut dan mengelus rambutmu."
    "He smiles softly and strokes your hair."

# game/script.rpy:128
translate English start_10876285:

    # t "Kenapa kau tidak membalas pesanku, hmm?"
    t "Why didn't you reply to my message, hmm?"

# game/script.rpy:142
translate English pilihan_jujur_88feaac8:

    # y "Maaf, Taeju-ya... Tadi aku benar-benar hampir terlambat, jadi tidak sempat mengecek ponsel sama sekali."
    y "Sorry, Taeju-ya... I was really almost late this morning, so I didn't get a chance to check my phone at all."

# game/script.rpy:145
translate English pilihan_jujur_05b3e5bf:

    # t "Sudah kuduga. Kamu kesiangan lagi, kan? Berhenti bergadang, Y/N."
    t "I knew it. You overslept again, didn't you? Stop staying up so late, Y/N."

# game/script.rpy:146
translate English pilihan_jujur_c5b609fe:

    # t "Kamu tahu sendiri kafemu ini tidak pernah sepi. Aku tidak mau kamu jatuh sakit karena terlalu memaksakan diri. Mengerti?"
    t "You know this café is never quiet. I don't want you getting sick from pushing yourself too hard. Understood?"

# game/script.rpy:152
translate English pilihan_jujur_37523a0e:

    # y "Iya, aku mengerti. Maaf ya sudah membuatmu khawatir."
    y "Yes, I understand. I'm sorry for making you worry."

# game/script.rpy:155
translate English pilihan_jujur_78a47d38:

    # "(Taeju merasa menang dan semakin menyukaimu.)"
    "(Taeju feels victorious and likes you even more.)"

# game/script.rpy:156
translate English pilihan_jujur_7f19252c:

    # t "Anak pintar."
    t "Good girl."

# game/script.rpy:160
translate English pilihan_jujur_d2708504:

    # y "Iya, iya... jangan mengomel terus."
    y "Okay, okay... stop nagging me."

# game/script.rpy:163
translate English pilihan_jujur_3aa73664:

    # "(Taeju merasa sedikit terabaikan, tapi tetap peduli.)"
    "(Taeju feels a little brushed off, but he still cares.)"

# game/script.rpy:164
translate English pilihan_jujur_be743aec:

    # t "Aku mengomel karena aku peduli, tahu."
    t "I nag because I care, you know."

# game/script.rpy:171
translate English pilihan_diam_9d5ebcef:

    # "Kamu terdiam sejenak, masih sedikit terguncang karena kejadian dengan Caesar tadi pagi."
    "You fall silent for a moment, still a little shaken by what happened with Caesar this morning."

# game/script.rpy:174
translate English pilihan_diam_64daddaa:

    # "(Senyum Taeju memudar, ekspresinya berubah khawatir. Dia memegang bahumu.)"
    "(Taeju's smile fades, his expression turning worried. He grips your shoulders.)"

# game/script.rpy:176
translate English pilihan_diam_b5036ffc:

    # t "Kenapa diam saja? Kamu sakit? Atau ada seseorang yang mengganggumu di jalan tadi?"
    t "Why so quiet? Are you sick? Or did someone bother you on the way here?"

# game/script.rpy:178
translate English pilihan_diam_c88744ef:

    # y "Ah, t-tidak. Bukan apa-apa."
    y "Ah, n-no. It's nothing."

# game/script.rpy:186
translate English after_choice_47972a6a:

    # t "Ah, sudahlah… Ambil ini dan segera makan."
    t "Ah, never mind… Take this and eat right away."

# game/script.rpy:187
translate English after_choice_dc774924:

    # t "Tempat makannya nanti saja dikembalikan."
    t "You can return the lunchbox later."

# game/script.rpy:190
translate English after_choice_c675d8a4:

    # "Dia mengacak-acak rambut kamu sesaat."
    "He ruffles your hair for a moment."

# game/script.rpy:191
translate English after_choice_aa693729:

    # t "Semangat bekerjanya!"
    t "Good luck with work!"

# game/script.rpy:204
translate English kembali_kerja_4af1aafa:

    # "Kamu kembali ke balik konter dengan perut kenyang. Bekal buatan Taeju memang tidak pernah gagal."
    "You return to the counter with a full stomach. Taeju's homemade lunches never disappoint."

# game/script.rpy:205
translate English kembali_kerja_aa9f0e54:

    # "Jam menunjukkan pukul dua siang. Café mulai lengang, hanya tersisa beberapa pelanggan."
    "The clock reads two in the afternoon. The café has quieted down, with only a few customers left."

# game/script.rpy:207
translate English kembali_kerja_0c12f930:

    # "Kamu sedang mengelap mesin kopi ketika lonceng pintu berbunyi."
    "You're wiping down the coffee machine when the doorbell chimes."

# game/script.rpy:210
translate English kembali_kerja_f0d085c5:

    # "Seketika suasana café terasa... berubah. Beberapa pelanggan melirik ke arah pintu, lalu buru-buru menunduk."
    "Instantly, the atmosphere of the café... shifts. A few customers glance toward the door, then hastily look down."

# game/script.rpy:215
translate English kembali_kerja_31782dbf:

    # "Pria bertubuh tinggi dengan mantel hitam itu berjalan santai ke arah konter. Kamu mengenali seringai itu."
    "A tall man in a black coat strolls casually toward the counter. You recognize that smirk."

# game/script.rpy:216
translate English kembali_kerja_7e1b02ee:

    # "Caesar. Pria yang kamu tabrak tadi pagi."
    "Caesar. The man you crashed into this morning."

# game/script.rpy:218
translate English kembali_kerja_6286e428:

    # c "Ternyata benar kau bekerja di sini, {i}Malen'kaya moya{/i}."
    c "So it's true — you do work here, {i}Malen'kaya moya{/i}."

# game/script.rpy:219
translate English kembali_kerja_11dc7dc0:

    # c "Aku mencarimu di setiap café di jalan itu. Kau tahu betapa merepotkannya itu?"
    c "I searched every café on that street for you. Do you know how much trouble that was?"

# game/script.rpy:225
translate English kembali_kerja_90b90c14:

    # y "K-kamu?! Kenapa bisa ada di sini?!"
    y "Y-you?! How are you here?!"

# game/script.rpy:227
translate English kembali_kerja_64eeaa71:

    # c "Kenapa? Kau tidak senang aku datang?"
    c "Why? Aren't you happy to see me?"

# game/script.rpy:228
translate English kembali_kerja_9a97d53e:

    # "Dia menopang dagunya di konter, menatapmu tanpa berkedip."
    "He rests his chin on the counter, staring at you without blinking."

# game/script.rpy:229
translate English kembali_kerja_f2176d7e:

    # c "Padahal aku sudah repot-repot mencarimu."
    c "And after I went through all that trouble to find you."

# game/script.rpy:233
translate English kembali_kerja_d1fc579b:

    # y "S-selamat datang. Mau pesan apa?"
    y "W-welcome. What can I get you?"

# game/script.rpy:235
translate English kembali_kerja_a916eea3:

    # "Caesar terdiam sesaat, lalu tertawa rendah. Sepertinya dia menyukai keberanianmu berpura-pura tenang."
    "Caesar pauses for a moment, then laughs low in his throat. He seems to enjoy your bold attempt at playing it cool."

# game/script.rpy:236
translate English kembali_kerja_89d64f46:

    # c "Menarik. Jantungmu berdebar kencang tapi kau tetap sok tenang."
    c "Interesting. Your heart is racing, yet you still pretend to be calm."

# game/script.rpy:237
translate English kembali_kerja_e5145fd5:

    # c "Baiklah. Satu americano. Dan satu jam waktumu."
    c "Very well. One americano. And one hour of your time."

# game/script.rpy:239
translate English kembali_kerja_a1f27f2b:

    # "Sebelum kamu sempat menjawab, dia meletakkan beberapa lembar uang di konter. Jauh lebih banyak dari harga kopi manapun di menu."
    "Before you can answer, he lays several bills on the counter. Far more than the price of any coffee on the menu."

# game/script.rpy:241
translate English kembali_kerja_d5515a8f:

    # c "Duduk dan temani aku makan siang. Aku tidak menerima penolakan."
    c "Sit down and join me for lunch. I won't take no for an answer."

# game/script.rpy:253
translate English makan_siang_caesar_6bae53d4:

    # "Entah bagaimana, kamu berakhir duduk di meja pojok bersama Caesar. Anehnya, tidak ada satu pun rekan kerjamu yang berani menegur."
    "Somehow, you end up sitting at the corner table with Caesar. Strangely, not a single one of your coworkers dares to say a word."

# game/script.rpy:255
translate English makan_siang_caesar_932ec3ea:

    # c "Jadi... siapa namamu? Aku tidak bisa terus memanggilmu 'gadis yang menabrakku'."
    c "So... what's your name? I can't keep calling you 'the girl who crashed into me'."

# game/script.rpy:257
translate English makan_siang_caesar_4bc1e22f:

    # y "...[player_name]."
    y "...[player_name]."

# game/script.rpy:259
translate English makan_siang_caesar_0eaa7f92:

    # c "[player_name]."
    c "[player_name]."

# game/script.rpy:260
translate English makan_siang_caesar_c8284df3:

    # "Dia mengulang namamu perlahan, seolah mencicipi setiap hurufnya."
    "He repeats your name slowly, as if savoring every letter."

# game/script.rpy:261
translate English makan_siang_caesar_af181f5f:

    # c "Nama yang manis. Cocok untukmu."
    c "A sweet name. It suits you."

# game/script.rpy:263
translate English makan_siang_caesar_3a51d17d:

    # "Kamu menunduk, berusaha menyembunyikan wajahmu yang memanas. Pria ini berbahaya — instingmu berteriak begitu. Tapi kenapa jantungmu tidak mau tenang?"
    "You look down, trying to hide your burning face. This man is dangerous — your instincts are screaming it. So why won't your heart calm down?"

# game/script.rpy:265
translate English makan_siang_caesar_54facab2:

    # c "Pagi tadi. Pria yang mengirimimu pesan itu... kekasihmu?"
    c "This morning. The man who texted you... your lover?"

# game/script.rpy:271
translate English makan_siang_caesar_c1d6aff5:

    # y "...Bukan urusanmu."
    y "...That's none of your business."

# game/script.rpy:273
translate English makan_siang_caesar_24d9bb2d:

    # "Mata Caesar menyala. Bukan marah — justru tertarik."
    "Caesar's eyes light up. Not with anger — with interest."

# game/script.rpy:274
translate English makan_siang_caesar_37085bd7:

    # c "Berani sekali. Aku semakin menyukaimu, {i}Malen'kaya moya{/i}."
    c "So bold. I like you more and more, {i}Malen'kaya moya{/i}."

# game/script.rpy:275
translate English makan_siang_caesar_673421e6:

    # c "Tapi kau belum menjawab. Berarti... bukan."
    c "But you didn't answer. Which means... he isn't."

# game/script.rpy:279
translate English makan_siang_caesar_a8ce0885:

    # y "D-dia temanku. Teman dekat."
    y "H-he's my friend. A close friend."

# game/script.rpy:281
translate English makan_siang_caesar_7ad2b2c5:

    # c "Teman dekat, hm?"
    c "A close friend, hm?"

# game/script.rpy:282
translate English makan_siang_caesar_7fd88b23:

    # "Dia bersandar, tersenyum puas seperti kucing besar yang menemukan mangsa."
    "He leans back, smiling with satisfaction, like a big cat that has found its prey."

# game/script.rpy:283
translate English makan_siang_caesar_27e3bb00:

    # c "Bagus. Berarti aku masih punya kesempatan."
    c "Good. That means I still have a chance."

# game/script.rpy:285
translate English makan_siang_caesar_c5223989:

    # "Caesar menghabiskan makanannya dengan santai, sesekali melontarkan pertanyaan yang membuatmu gugup."
    "Caesar finishes his meal at a leisurely pace, occasionally tossing out questions that make you nervous."

# game/script.rpy:286
translate English makan_siang_caesar_975751b5:

    # "Saat akhirnya dia berdiri untuk pergi, dia menunduk mendekat ke telingamu."
    "When he finally stands up to leave, he leans down close to your ear."

# game/script.rpy:288
translate English makan_siang_caesar_57889c00:

    # c "Sampai jumpa lagi, [player_name]. Dan percayalah... akan ada 'lagi'."
    c "See you again, [player_name]. And trust me... there {i}will{/i} be an 'again'."

# game/script.rpy:290
translate English makan_siang_caesar_5aee7294:

    # "Dia pergi begitu saja, meninggalkan aroma parfum maskulin dan jantungmu yang berantakan."
    "He walks away just like that, leaving behind the scent of masculine cologne and your heart in complete disarray."

# game/script.rpy:300
translate English zhenya_muncul_bfed5e05:

    # "Kamu baru saja akan membereskan meja ketika sebuah suara dalam terdengar dari belakangmu."
    "You're just about to clear the table when a deep voice sounds from behind you."

# game/script.rpy:302
translate English zhenya_muncul_4a41af31:

    # z "Kau tahu siapa pria itu, [player_name]?"
    z "Do you know who that man is, [player_name]?"

# game/script.rpy:308
translate English zhenya_muncul_7fa66465:

    # "Kamu terlonjak dan berbalik. Zhenya — pemilik café ini — berdiri tepat di belakangmu. Sejak kapan?!"
    "You jump and spin around. Zhenya — the owner of this café — is standing right behind you. Since when?!"

# game/script.rpy:309
translate English zhenya_muncul_97da008d:

    # "Bosmu yang biasanya hanya muncul sesekali itu kini menatap pintu keluar dengan ekspresi yang belum pernah kamu lihat. Dingin. Tajam."
    "Your boss, who usually only drops by now and then, is now staring at the exit with an expression you've never seen before. Cold. Sharp."

# game/script.rpy:315
translate English zhenya_muncul_a926d66f:

    # "Tiba-tiba dia melangkah maju, memerangkapmu antara tubuhnya dan meja. Aura santainya yang biasa menghilang tanpa jejak."
    "Suddenly he steps forward, trapping you between his body and the table. His usual laid-back aura vanishes without a trace."

# game/script.rpy:317
translate English zhenya_muncul_19446adf:

    # z "Jawab aku. Kau kenal Caesar Volkov?"
    z "Answer me. Do you know Caesar Volkov?"

# game/script.rpy:319
translate English zhenya_muncul_9cd7a22e:

    # y "V-Volkov...? Aku... aku hanya menabraknya tadi pagi, sungguh!"
    y "V-Volkov...? I... I just bumped into him this morning, I swear!"

# game/script.rpy:321
translate English zhenya_muncul_a87599bb:

    # "Zhenya menatapmu lama, seolah membaca isi kepalamu. Lalu dia menghela napas."
    "Zhenya stares at you for a long moment, as if reading your mind. Then he sighs."

# game/script.rpy:323
translate English zhenya_muncul_485d128a:

    # z "Menjauh darinya. Pria itu bukan orang yang bisa kau hadapi."
    z "Stay away from him. That man is not someone you can handle."

# game/script.rpy:329
translate English zhenya_muncul_f7c7e5fc:

    # y "...Kenapa kamu bisa tahu tentang dia? Kalian saling kenal?"
    y "...How do you know about him? Do you two know each other?"

# game/script.rpy:331
translate English zhenya_muncul_407ceb96:

    # "Rahang Zhenya mengeras. Untuk sesaat, kamu melihat sesuatu di matanya — masa lalu yang gelap."
    "Zhenya's jaw tightens. For a moment, you see something in his eyes — a dark past."

# game/script.rpy:332
translate English zhenya_muncul_70fd45a9:

    # z "Anak pintar bertanya di saat yang salah."
    z "A clever girl asking questions at the wrong time."

# game/script.rpy:333
translate English zhenya_muncul_d2e36f82:

    # z "Cukup tahu bahwa aku dan dia... berasal dari dunia yang sama. Dan aku keluar dari sana bukan tanpa alasan."
    z "It's enough for you to know that he and I... come from the same world. And I didn't leave it without a reason."

# game/script.rpy:337
translate English zhenya_muncul_df7dcf56:

    # y "B-baik... aku mengerti..."
    y "O-okay... I understand..."

# game/script.rpy:339
translate English zhenya_muncul_1024c3ad:

    # "Ekspresi Zhenya melunak sedikit. Dia mengusap puncak kepalamu — gestur yang tidak pernah dia lakukan sebelumnya."
    "Zhenya's expression softens slightly. He pats the top of your head — a gesture he's never made before."

# game/script.rpy:340
translate English zhenya_muncul_72655efa:

    # z "Bagus. Aku tidak mempekerjakanmu untuk melihatmu terseret ke dalam masalah."
    z "Good. I didn't hire you just to watch you get dragged into trouble."

# game/script.rpy:342
translate English zhenya_muncul_98ac41f6:

    # z "Satu hal lagi."
    z "One more thing."

# game/script.rpy:343
translate English zhenya_muncul_ca4d18c4:

    # "Dia mencondongkan tubuh, suaranya turun menjadi bisikan."
    "He leans in, his voice dropping to a whisper."

# game/script.rpy:344
translate English zhenya_muncul_e43337d7:

    # z "Kalau dia datang lagi ke sini... langsung beritahu aku. Ini perintah."
    z "If he ever comes here again... tell me immediately. That's an order."

# game/script.rpy:346
translate English zhenya_muncul_2bd4a971:

    # "Dia menegakkan tubuh dan berjalan pergi seolah tidak terjadi apa-apa, meninggalkanmu dengan seribu pertanyaan."
    "He straightens up and walks away as if nothing happened, leaving you with a thousand questions."

# game/script.rpy:347
translate English zhenya_muncul_56286419:

    # "Siapa sebenarnya Zhenya? Dan apa hubungannya dengan Caesar?"
    "Who is Zhenya, really? And what is his connection to Caesar?"

# game/script.rpy:361
translate English pulang_dengan_taeju_be61ca6d:

    # "Pukul delapan malam. Shift-mu akhirnya selesai."
    "Eight in the evening. Your shift is finally over."

# game/script.rpy:362
translate English pulang_dengan_taeju_79b97bf3:

    # "Begitu keluar dari café, kamu menemukan sosok familiar bersandar di dinding sambil memainkan ponselnya."
    "As soon as you step out of the café, you spot a familiar figure leaning against the wall, playing with his phone."

# game/script.rpy:366
translate English pulang_dengan_taeju_074c576a:

    # t "Kerja bagus hari ini."
    t "Good work today."

# game/script.rpy:368
translate English pulang_dengan_taeju_36e6dd37:

    # y "Taeju?! Kamu menungguku?"
    y "Taeju?! You waited for me?"

# game/script.rpy:370
translate English pulang_dengan_taeju_f287d78a:

    # t "Tentu saja. Hari ini kamu aneh sejak siang. Mana mungkin aku membiarkanmu pulang sendirian."
    t "Of course. You've been acting strange since noon. There's no way I'd let you walk home alone."

# game/script.rpy:378
translate English pulang_dengan_taeju_74ed7e02:

    # "Kalian berakhir duduk santai berdua, ditemani angin malam. Kamu mengembalikan kotak bekalnya yang sudah kosong."
    "The two of you end up sitting together, relaxing in the night breeze. You hand back his now-empty lunchbox."

# game/script.rpy:380
translate English pulang_dengan_taeju_1b857112:

    # t "Habis. Anak baik."
    t "All finished. Good girl."

# game/script.rpy:381
translate English pulang_dengan_taeju_e79058af:

    # "Dia tersenyum puas melihat kotak bekal yang bersih."
    "He smiles contentedly at the spotless lunchbox."

# game/script.rpy:383
translate English pulang_dengan_taeju_464fba13:

    # t "Jadi... mau cerita? Ada apa hari ini?"
    t "So... want to tell me? What happened today?"

# game/script.rpy:384
translate English pulang_dengan_taeju_1a634c93:

    # "Tatapannya lembut, tapi kamu tahu Taeju — dia tidak akan berhenti bertanya sampai kamu bicara."
    "His gaze is gentle, but you know Taeju — he won't stop asking until you talk."

# game/script.rpy:390
translate English pulang_dengan_taeju_9a0fb935:

    # y "Tadi pagi... waktu aku hampir telat, aku menabrak seseorang di jalan. Dan siangnya dia tiba-tiba datang ke café."
    y "This morning... when I was almost late, I crashed into someone on the street. And this afternoon, he suddenly showed up at the café."

# game/script.rpy:392
translate English pulang_dengan_taeju_e48208ba:

    # "Taeju terdiam. Senyumnya masih ada, tapi matanya berubah serius."
    "Taeju goes quiet. His smile remains, but his eyes turn serious."

# game/script.rpy:393
translate English pulang_dengan_taeju_89312390:

    # t "Dia melakukan sesuatu padamu?"
    t "Did he do something to you?"

# game/script.rpy:394
translate English pulang_dengan_taeju_f921e2a6:

    # y "Tidak! Dia cuma... mengajakku bicara."
    y "No! He just... talked to me."

# game/script.rpy:395
translate English pulang_dengan_taeju_f3741d67:

    # t "...Hm. Kalau dia datang lagi dan membuatmu tidak nyaman, telepon aku. Detik itu juga. Janji?"
    t "...Hm. If he shows up again and makes you uncomfortable, call me. That very second. Promise?"

# game/script.rpy:396
translate English pulang_dengan_taeju_d769fcf3:

    # "Dia mengulurkan jari kelingkingnya. Kekanakan, tapi entah kenapa membuatmu merasa aman."
    "He holds out his pinky finger. Childish, but somehow it makes you feel safe."

# game/script.rpy:399
translate English pulang_dengan_taeju_534b364d:

    # y "Bukan apa-apa kok. Cuma capek, pelanggan hari ini ramai sekali."
    y "It's nothing, really. I'm just tired — we had so many customers today."

# game/script.rpy:401
translate English pulang_dengan_taeju_9ec86827:

    # "Taeju menatapmu beberapa detik. Kamu tahu dia tidak sepenuhnya percaya."
    "Taeju looks at you for a few seconds. You know he doesn't fully believe you."

# game/script.rpy:402
translate English pulang_dengan_taeju_5ccdc305:

    # t "...Baiklah, kalau kamu bilang begitu."
    t "...Alright, if you say so."

# game/script.rpy:403
translate English pulang_dengan_taeju_bba85eae:

    # t "Tapi ingat, [player_name]. Aku selalu tahu kalau kamu berbohong. Aku cuma menunggu kamu siap cerita."
    t "But remember, [player_name]. I always know when you're lying. I'm just waiting until you're ready to talk."

# game/script.rpy:404
translate English pulang_dengan_taeju_96cdd6e9:

    # "Ada nada terluka tipis di suaranya yang membuat dadamu sedikit sesak."
    "There's a faint note of hurt in his voice that makes your chest tighten."

# game/script.rpy:406
translate English pulang_dengan_taeju_60fed25a:

    # "Sisa malam itu kalian habiskan dengan obrolan ringan. Bersama Taeju, dunia selalu terasa lebih pelan dan hangat."
    "You spend the rest of the night in light conversation. With Taeju, the world always feels slower and warmer."

# game/script.rpy:407
translate English pulang_dengan_taeju_da7662c4:

    # "Tapi jauh di dalam hatimu, kamu tahu — hari ini sesuatu telah berubah. Tiga pria, tiga dunia yang berbeda... dan kamu berdiri tepat di tengahnya."
    "But deep in your heart, you know — something changed today. Three men, three different worlds... and you stand right in the middle of them."

# game/script.rpy:419
translate English penutup_hari_1_a0e9849a:

    # centered "{i}Hari Pertama — Selesai{/i}"
    centered "{i}Day One — Complete{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:422
translate English penutup_hari_1_b663f106:

    # "Poin Taeju: [love_taeju] | Poin Caesar: [love_caesar] | Poin Zhenya: [love_zhenya]"
    "Taeju Points: [love_taeju] | Caesar Points: [love_caesar] | Zhenya Points: [love_zhenya]"

# game/script.rpy:424
translate English penutup_hari_1_ad480e33:

    # "— Bersambung —"
    "— To Be Continued —"

